{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52006","headline":"山夜 · 王绩","name":"山夜","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仲尼初返鲁，藏史欲辞周。\n脱落四方事，栖遑万里游。\n影来徒自责，心尽更何求？\n礼乐存三代，烟霞主一丘。\n长歌明月在，独坐白云浮。\n物情劳倚伏，生涯任去留。\n百年一如此，世事方悠悠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王绩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52006.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52006","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}